      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "## Cron: process-inbox (09:40 UTC) - **olga-test-dashboard.json** — Olga requests a dashboard for \"запрос программы курса\" - Discovered: \"Запрос программы курса\" is a Pre-Sale deal type (C8 category), not a traffic source - Written response to outbox/b394e02a... asking for clarification on period and metrics - Marked as processed in inbox",
